In short, for orientation only (the terms below are what govern):

- Plexora Free -- everything Plexora does without a licence -- may be used by
  anyone, for any purpose, including commercial use, at no charge and with no
  account.
- Plexora Pro is a paid subscription, per Seat and per term, bought for an
  academic or a commercial Use Class at https://account.biocognia.com.
- Plugins are welcome: you may build and distribute them freely, and you own
  what you write.
- You may not publish a modified copy or fork of Plexora itself.

